WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.020
Every answer is one tap away now.

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:07.760
It has never been easier to stop thinking.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.140
Keating is built for the other moment — when you look up, and want to understand.

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:19.367
It asks before it tells.

00:00:19.927 --> 00:00:24.227
It lets you get stuck — and stays with you while you work it out.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:31.687
It checks your work honestly, remembers what you've learned, and brings it back when it matters.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.220
Not to think for you.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.500
To help you see further — on your own.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:40.840
Keating.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:45.120
A teacher that makes you the one who knows.
